  "an10.144:1.1": "vo bhikkhave dhammaṃ desissāmi sukhavipākañ ca, ",
  "an10.144:1.2": "taṃ suṇātha . . . pe . . . 2. ",
  "an10.144:1.3": "Katamo ca bhikkhave dukkhavipāko dhammo? ",
  "an10.144:1.4": "Micchādiṭṭhi . . . pe . . . micchāvimutti. ",
  "an10.144:1.5": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave dukkhavipāko dhammo. 3. ",
  "an10.144:1.6": "Katamo ca bhikkhave sukhavipāko dhammo? ",
  "an10.144:1.7": "Sammādiṭṭhi . . . pe . . . sammāvimutti. ",
  "an10.144:1.8": "Ayaṃ vuccati bhikkhave sukhavipāko dhammo ",
  "an10.144:1.9": "ti. 1. ",
  "an10.144:1.10": "Ariyamaggañ ca "
